# Optional. Satellite works WITHOUT this: with no key the viewer uses EOX Sentinel-2
# cloudless, which is keyless and CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 — non-commercial, which is what looking at
# your own motorcycle's history is.
#
# A key swaps in MapTiler's aerial imagery instead, for one reason: EOX is 10 m Sentinel-2 and
# overzooms into mush past roughly z14, while MapTiler keeps resolving. Get a free one at
# https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/ and paste it below as map/.env (not .env.example).
#
# ⚠️ A FREE MapTiler account is "suitable for testing, personal or non-commercial use", must
# display the MapTiler LOGO as well as the text (the page adds it), and pauses rather than
# bills when the monthly quota runs out. Raster costs 10–16 requests per map view against 4
# for vector, so satellite burns quota several times faster than the default map.
PUBLIC_MAPTILER_KEY=
